								"items" : [
									{
										"__type" : "textSnippet",
										"children" : {
											"__type" : "snippets",
											"items" : [ ]
										},
										"createEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"createTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574289+01:00"
											}
										},
										"editEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"editTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:53.808138+01:00"
											}
										},
										"uid" : {
											"__type" : "uid",
											"uidString" : "0rsc3fRfSBeMfNQeWgvKaQ=="
										},
										"paragraphStyle" : {
											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "- **Strong subscriptions** behave as before: the announcer keeps their subscribers alive.\n- **Weak subscriptions** reference their subscriber weakly. Instead of one entry per subscription in the global {{gtClass:FinalizationRegistry}}, the registry keeps one ephemeron per weak subscriber itself, so a live weak subscriber can no longer keep the announcer and its strong subscribers alive, and unsubscribing leaves nothing behind."
									}
								]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:53.803262+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:53.803262+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "mUydtzu8SuGYNQMRPyc8dA=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistry}} is a subscription registry an {{gtClass:Announcer}} can use instead of Pharo's {{gtClass:SubscriptionRegistry}}. It understands the same messages and accepts the same subscriptions, and it lets one announcer have strong and weak subscribers at the same time without leaking:"
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574319+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574319+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "OPW/vpQDRzyQiuMdQ4ZnzQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Why Pharo's registries leak in this situation, and how this one avoids it, is explained on the page \"How mixing weak and strong announcement subscriptions leaks memory\"."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [
									{
										"__type" : "textSnippet",
										"children" : {
											"__type" : "snippets",
											"items" : [ ]
										},
										"createEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"createTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.57433+01:00"
											}
										},
										"editEmail" : {
											"__type" : "email",
											"emailString" : "<unknown>"
										},
										"editTime" : {
											"__type" : "time",
											"time" : {
												"__type" : "dateAndTime",
												"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.57433+01:00"
											}
										},
										"uid" : {
											"__type" : "uid",
											"uidString" : "vj9aQLDkTWSvZj6etNUviA=="
										},
										"paragraphStyle" : {
											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "The registry keeps its strong subscriptions in a set, as Pharo does. Its weak subscriptions are grouped by subscriber, and each group is held behind one ephemeron, keyed on the subscriber, that only the registry references. When a weak subscriber is garbage collected, the registry drops its whole group; unsubscribing simply removes the group. Announcers without weak subscribers share one empty weak part, so they pay nothing for it. How the registry locks, matches and delivers is described on the design page."
									}
								]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574327+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574327+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "9nbuPopOSpKX95ddGjSQwQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "# How it works"
						}
					]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574165+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574165+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "Rp6eUMoqS4O9chfdgG8dXw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# What it is"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:26:16.320347+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:26:16.320347+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "h0fHqe+sRmqAr5C+npBE8Q=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Install the registry when the announcer is created, then subscribe as with any announcer. Strong subscriptions are made as usual, weak ones through {{gtMethod:Announcer>>#weak|label=#selector}}; a weak block subscription always names its subscriber with {{gtMethod:GtEphemeronSubscriptionBuilder>>#when:do:for:|label=#selector}}, and lives as long as that object. "
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574332+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:26:16.324596+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "/hsdWXE0QUmtBO5lnBya8w=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "In this snippet the model is subscribed strongly and the element weakly, once with a message and once with a block; after {{gtMethod:Announcer>>#unsubscribe:|label=#selector}} only the model's subscription remains:"
						},
						{
							"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574338+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574338+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "sWJZMGZKRye4MFRGYs37Hg=="
							},
							"code" : "| announcer aModel anElement |\nannouncer := Announcer new useMixedSubscriptionRegistry.\naModel := OrderedCollection new.\nanElement := OrderedCollection new.\nannouncer when: Announcement send: #add: to: aModel.\nannouncer weak when: Announcement send: #add: to: anElement.\nannouncer weak\n\twhen: Announcement\n\tdo: [ :anAnnouncement | anElement add: anAnnouncement ]\n\tfor: anElement.\nannouncer announce: Announcement new.\nannouncer unsubscribe: anElement.\nannouncer"
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:26:19.840227+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:26:19.840227+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "mqFvCPioS1qUFx43C09NHg=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The block refers to `anElement`. With a plain registry this weak block subscription would keep `anElement` alive as long as the announcer lives; with the mixed registry it does not."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:25:43.574343+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-22T16:26:19.845321+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "cba34VHfSlmpVjINotltxw=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The next example shows what a weak subscription is in this registry: {{gtMethod:Announcer>>#weak|label=#selector}} {{gtMethod:GtEphemeronSubscriptionBuilder>>#when:send:to:|label=#selector}} creates a {{gtClass:GtEphemeronAnnouncementSubscription}} whose action is a {{gtClass:WeakMessageSend}}; it is kept in the weak part (no strong subscriptions, one weak subscriber), and only announcements it handles reach the subscriber (a {{gtClass:JobStart}} does, a {{gtClass:JobEnd}} does not). It answers the announcer, which can be inspected:\n\n{{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistryExamples>>#weakSubscriptionDelivers|expanded}}\n\nA weak subscription without a subscriber, or whose action is its own subscriber, is refused with an error, because it could never be collected or would vanish at the next garbage collection ({{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistryExamples>>#weakSubscriptionNeedsASubscriber}}, {{gtMethod:GtMixedSubscriptionRegistryExamples>>#valuableThatIsItsOwnSubscriberCannotBeSubscribedWeakly}})."
						}
					]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
